      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Upon further thinking, this probably requires you to have the exact setup needed for proper eye tracking including the bone hierarchy to be named properly. \n\nEither way, prior to this build, unlinking the bones in mecanim would stop eye tracking from controlling the faces blendshapes at all. Didn't matter if your heirarchy was \"correct.\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
